Package: neximageeditor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         qt6-image-formats-plugins
Description: Layer-based image editor written in C++17 and Qt6
 NexImageEditor is a lightweight raster image editor with a Photoshop-style
 layout: toolbox, options bar, document tabs, and Layers, Properties and
 History panels. It supports selections (rectangle, ellipse, lasso, magic
 wand), painting tools, gradients, raster text and shapes, free transform,
 crop, adjustments, filters with live preview, undo/redo, and PNG/JPEG/WebP/
 BMP/TIFF import and export, plus its own .nxe project format.
